#: includes/admin.php:295
msgid ""
"One per line. Views of these addresses are added to this page, e.g. after "
"moving it. Old slugs of posts are added automatically."
msgstr "Jedan po retku. Pregledi tih adresa pribrajaju se ovoj stranici, npr. nakon selidbe. Stari slugovi objava dodaju se automatski."

